// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// chan.c 秋风尘法 缠字诀
#include <ansi.h>
inherit F_SSERVER;
int perform(object me, object target)
{
    string msg;
    if( !target ) target = offensive_target(me);
    if( !target
    ||  !target->is_character()
    ||  !me->is_fighting(target) )
        return notify_fail("牵制攻击只能对战斗中的对手使用。\n");
    if( target->is_busy() )
        return notify_fail(target->name() + "目前正自顾不暇，放胆攻击吧。\n");
    msg = CYN "$N使出秋风尘法「缠」字诀，拂尘连挥企图把$n的全身缠住。\n";
    me->start_busy(random(1));
    if( random(me->query("combat_exp")) > (int)target->query("combat_exp")/2 ) {
        msg += "结果$p被$P攻了个措手不及。\n" NOR;
        target->start_busy( (int)me->query_skill("qiufeng-chenfa") / 20 + 2);
    } else {
        msg += "可是$p看破了$P的企图，并没有上当。\n" NOR;
        me->start_busy(4);
    }
    message_vision(msg, me, target);
    return 1;
}
